(86, 'privacy_policy', '<p><strong>Dear Customer</strong><br />\r\nWe are delighted by your interest in safeguarding your data. Our priority is to provide you with a clear understanding of our data processing practices and our commitment to privacy compliance across our delivery platforms, applications, and associated services (referred to collectively as &quot;platform&quot; below). Our mission is to ensure an exceptional customer experience while prioritizing the security of your data. Trust, transparency, and integrity guide our actions, as we believe that honesty is fundamental to any partnership.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Our Identity</strong><br />\r\nIn managing the processing activities on our platform, we assume the role of the data controller responsible for the handling of your data. As a &quot;data controller,&quot; we determine the purposes, means, and methods of processing your data. While legal obligations require us to furnish you with comprehensive information, we are driven by the ethos that openness is the cornerstone of any relationship.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Privacy Empowerment</strong><br />\r\nWe recognize privacy as your fundamental right, and we respect your autonomy in making choices regarding your data. As a customer, you retain the autonomy to decide the extent of information you wish to share with us. However, upon signing up for our platform, adherence to our terms of use is mandatory. This contractual agreement empowers you to access and utilize the platform as per the specified terms. While certain information is necessary for us to fulfill our contractual obligations, the decision to provide such information ultimately rests with you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To exercise control over the personal data you share with us, consider the following options:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can take the following steps to control and manage how much personal data you share with us:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Managing Cookies &amp; Web Tracking&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nYou have the liberty to configure your device or web browser settings to reject cookies and other web-tracking technologies. Alternatively, you can utilize our consent manager to control these preferences. Opting out of web tracking may result in the unavailability of personalized content, offers, or advertisements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Opting Out of Direct Marketing</strong>Should you prefer not to receive newsletters from us, you have the option to unsubscribe at any time. While this choice entails foregoing enticing offers, we respect your decision.</p>', 'admin_landing_page', '2024-03-19 14:57:47', '2024-03-20 11:50:31'),
(87, 'about_us', '<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Product Descriptions:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Our product descriptions are meticulously crafted to provide you with detailed information about each item.</li>\r\n		<li>You&#39;ll find accurate specifications, features, and usage guidelines to help you make informed purchasing decisions.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Educational Resources:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>We believe in empowering our customers with knowledge. Look out for our blog posts, articles, and guides covering topics.</li>\r\n		<li>From how-to guides to product comparisons, our educational resources aim to enhance your shopping experience and help you get the most out of our products.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Inspiration and Ideas:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>Need inspiration for your next project or gift idea? Explore our curated collections and gift guides for inspiration.</li>\r\n		<li>Discover unique and innovative products that cater to various interests, lifestyles, and occasions.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>User-generated Content:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>We love hearing from our customers! Share your experiences with our products by tagging us on social media or submitting reviews.</li>\r\n		<li>User-generated content adds authenticity and value to our community, helping others make informed decisions.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Customer Support:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li>If you have any questions about our products or need assistance, our customer support team is here to help.</li>\r\n		<li>Reach out to us via email, and we&#39;ll be happy to assist you.</li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>', 'admin_landing_page', '2024-03-20 11:54:47', '2024-03-20 11:54:47'),
(88, 'about_title', 'About Us', 'admin_landing_page', '2024-03-20 11:54:47', '2024-03-20 11:54:47'),
(89, 'terms_and_conditions', '<p>These terms and conditions govern your use of Join Market and constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Join Market. By accessing or using our website, you agree to comply with these terms and conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you may not use our website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Use of the Website</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.1. You are responsible for ensuring that all information you provide on our website is accurate, current, and complete. You agree to promptly update your account and other information, including your email address and payment details, as necessary.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.2. You must not use our website in any way that causes, or may cause, damage to the website or impairment of the availability or accessibility of the website; or in any way that is unlawful, illegal, fraudulent, or harmful.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.3. You must not use our website to copy, store, host, transmit, send, use, publish, or distribute any material that consists of (or is linked to) any spyware, computer virus, Trojan horse, worm, keystroke logger, rootkit or other malicious computer software.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.4. You must not conduct any systematic or automated data collection activities (including without limitation scraping, data mining, data extraction, and data harvesting) on or about our website without our express written consent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Intellectual Property</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.1. Unless otherwise stated, we or our licensors own the intellectual property rights in the website and material on the website. Subject to the license below, all these intellectual property rights are reserved.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.2. You may view, download for caching purposes only, and print pages from the website for your personal use, subject to the restrictions set out below and elsewhere in these terms and conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.3. You must not:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a) Republish material from this website (including republication on another website); (b) Sell, rent, or sub-license material from the website; (c) Show any material from the website in public; (d) Reproduce, duplicate, copy or otherwise exploit material on our website for a commercial purpose; (e) Edit or otherwise modify any material on the website; or (f) Redistribute material from this website except for content specifically and expressly made available for redistribution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. Limitation of Liability</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.1. Join Market will not be liable to you (whether under the law of contact, the law of torts, or otherwise) about the contents of, or use of, or otherwise in connection with, this website:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a) To the extent that the website is provided free of charge for any direct loss; (b) For any indirect, special, or consequential loss; or (c) For any business losses, loss of revenue, income, profits, or anticipated savings, loss of contracts or business relationships, loss of reputation or goodwill, or loss or corruption of information or data.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.2. These limitations of liability apply even if Join Market has been expressly advised of the potential loss.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Indemnity</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.1. You hereby indemnify Join Market and undertake to keep Join Market indemnified against any losses, damages, costs, liabilities, and expenses (including without limitation legal expenses and any amounts paid by Join Market to a third party in settlement of a claim or dispute on the advice of Join Market legal advisers) incurred or suffered by Join Market arising out of any breach by you of any provision of these terms and conditions</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Variation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.1. Join Market may revise these terms and conditions from time to time. Revised terms and conditions will apply to the use of our website from the date of the publication of the revised terms and conditions on our website. Please check this page regularly to ensure you are familiar with the current version.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6. Assignment</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>6.1. Join Market may transfer, sub-contract, or otherwise deal with Join Market rights and/or obligations under these terms and conditions without notifying you or obtaining your consent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6.2. You may not transfer, sub-contract, or otherwise deal with your rights and/or obligations under these terms and conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>7. Severability</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>7.1. If a provision of these terms and conditions is determined by any court or other competent authority to be unlawful and/or unenforceable, the other provisions will continue in effect. If any unlawful and/or unenforceable provision would be lawful or enforceable if part of it were deleted, that part will be deemed to be deleted, and the rest of the provision will continue in effect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>8. Entire Agreement</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>8.1. These terms and conditions, together with our Privacy Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and Join Market&nbsp;about your use of this website and supersede all previous agreements in respect of your use of this website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>9. Contact Information</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any questions about these terms and conditions, please contact us.</p>', 'admin_landing_page', '2024-03-20 12:00:03', '2024-03-20 12:00:03');
