(1, 2, 100001, '5.00', '{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Vape D1\",\"description\":\"Check out the Uwell Caliburn GK3 25W Pod System, featuring a 900mAh integrated battery, 25W maximum output, and utilizes the 2mL Caliburn G3 pods. Constructed from lightweight PCTG materials, the Caliburn GK3 offers a strong and resilient chassis while remaining visually striking with the futuristic body combined with a large digital screen. In addition, the Caliburn G3 pods contain a 0.6ohm or 0.9ohm coil, making full use of the adjustable 25W maximum to help unlock the complex layers of your favorite e-Juice or nicotine salt. Furthermore, the Caliburn GK3 possesses a 900mAh integrated battery that can be recharged via Type-C port for faster and more consistent recharging, leading to less down time.\\r\\n\\r\\nUWELL CALIBURN GK3 25W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\\r\\nDIMENSIONS: 74.8mm by 49.2mm by 17.1mm\\r\\nBATTERY CAPACITY: 900mAh\\r\\nBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\\r\\nWATTAGE RANGE: 25W\\r\\nCHASSIS MATERIAL: PCTG, PC + ABS\\r\\nDISPLAY SCREEN: Digital Screen\\r\\nOPERATION: Draw-Activated\\r\\nOUTPUT: Adjustable Wattage\\r\\nCHARGING: USB Type-C\\r\\nPOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\\r\\nPOD CAPACITY: 2mL\\r\\nPOD MATERIAL: PCTG\\r\\nFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\\r\\nAIRFLOW: Fixed\\r\\nINCLUDES:\\r\\n1 Caliburn GK3 Device\\r\\n1 0.6ohm Caliburn G3 Pods\\r\\n1 0.9ohm Caliburn G3 Pods\\r\\n1 Type-C Cable\\r\\n1 Lanyard\\r\\n1 User Manual\\r\\n \\r\\nMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\",\"image\":\"2024-02-05-65c08e73a7faa.png\",\"category_id\":2,\"category_ids\":[{\"id\":\"1\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Demo category\"},{\"id\":\"2\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Demo sub category\"}],\"variations\":[],\"add_ons\":[],\"attributes\":[],\"choice_options\":[],\"price\":5,\"tax\":0,\"tax_type\":\"percent\",\"discount\":0,\"discount_type\":\"percent\",\"available_time_starts\":\"00:00:00\",\"available_time_ends\":\"23:59:59\",\"veg\":0,\"status\":1,\"store_id\":2,\"created_at\":