(3, 5, 100003, '1.00', '{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Marlboro Ice Blast Cigarette\",\"description\":\"Marlboro Ice Blast Cigarette\\r\\n1 pc\",\"image\":\"2024-02-27-65dd84e36485c.png\",\"category_id\":3,\"category_ids\":[{\"id\":\"3\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Cigarette\"}],\"variations\":[],\"add_ons\":[],\"attributes\":[],\"choice_options\":[],\"price\":1,\"tax\":0,\"tax_type\":\"percent\",\"discount\":0,\"discount_type\":\"percent\",\"available_time_starts\":\"00:00:00\",\"available_time_ends\":\"23:59:59\",\"veg\":0,\"status\":1,\"store_id\":2,\"created_at\":\"2024-02-05T09:32:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-02-27T06:44:58.000000Z\",\"order_count\":0,\"avg_rating\":0,\"rating_count\":0,\"module_id\":1,\"stock\":100,\"unit_id\":null,\"images\":[\"2024-02-27-65dd84e364474.png\"],\"food_variations\":[],\"slug\":\"marlboro-ice-blast-cigarette\",\"recommended\":0,\"organic\":0,\"maximum_cart_quantity\":5,\"is_approved\":1,\"store_name\":\"smoke sphere\",\"is_campaign\":0,\"module_type\":\"grocery\",\"zone_id\":2,\"flash_sale\":0,\"store_discount\":0,\"schedule_order\":false,\"min_delivery_time\":30,\"max_delivery_time\":60,\"common_condition_id\":0,\"is_basic\":0,\"unit_type\":null,\"module\":{\"id\":1,\"module_name\":\"Smoking and Vaping Essentials\",\"module_type\":\"grocery\",\"thumbnail\":\"2024-02-23-65d87be6ce678.png\",\"status\":\"1\",\"stores_count\":6,\"created_at\":\"2023-08-15T18:31:17.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-02-23T11:31:12.000000Z\",\"icon\":\"2024-02-23-65d87be6ce4bc.png\",\"theme_id\":1,\"description\":\"<p>&quot;Smoking and Vaping Essentials&quot; encompasses a wide range of products that are considered fundamental for individuals who smoke or vape. This category includes items that are necessary or commonly used in the act of smoking or vaping, as well as products that enhance the overall experience. Some examples of products that fall under this category are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Vaping Devices:<\\/strong> This includes electronic cigarettes, vape pens, box mods, and pod systems that are used for vaporizing e-liquids or other vaping substances.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>E-liquids or Vape Juices:<\\/strong> These are liquids that contain nicotine, flavorings, and other ingredients used in electronic cigarettes and vaporizers to produce vapor for inhalation.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Tobacco Products:<\\/strong> Traditional tobacco products such as cigarettes, cigars, pipe tobacco, and rolling tobacco are often included in this category for smokers.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Lighters and Matches:<\\/strong> Essential tools for lighting cigarettes, cigars, pipes, or other smoking materials.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Ashtrays:<\\/strong> Containers designed to hold ash and cigarette or cigar butts, helping to keep smoking areas clean.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Cleaning and Maintenance Tools:<\\/strong> Brushes, wipes, and other accessories used for cleaning and maintaining vaping devices or smoking accessories like pipes or bongs.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Replacement Parts and Accessories:<\\/strong> Coils, tanks, drip tips, batteries, and other components or accessories needed to keep vaping devices functioning properly.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Filters and Rolling Papers:<\\/strong> These items are used by smokers who prefer to roll their cigarettes or joints, providing them with the necessary supplies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Pipe Cleaners and Screens:<\\/strong> Essential tools for cleaning pipes and preventing the inhalation of unwanted debris.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/li>\\r\\n\\t<li>\\r\\n\\t<p><strong>Storage Containers:<\\/strong> Containers are designed to store tobacco, herbs, or vaping supplies in a convenient and organized manner.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\t<\\/